# Wilma, the orange office cat. She lives under Wolfgang's desk in her round cushion.
#
# Same format as characters/wolfgang/desk.sprite (`.` is transparent). Every frame has its own size;
# the app draws frames with their bottom centre on Wilma's spot on the floor. In her
# cushion she lies one row above the top of `bedfront`, which is drawn over her.
# Side views face right; the app mirrors them when she walks left.
# Her daily routine (sleeping, waking, wandering, washing …) is in app.js (`Wilma`).
#
# Sleeping, sitting and walking are taken from the character study in
# assets/reference/wilma-study.jpeg (2026-11-09); the other frames are derived from them.

size 18 9
# Bottom centre of her cushion, under the desk between the drawers.
origin 163 172

color O 2f1810  # outline, eyes
color D a24e20  # tabby stripes
color d b05e2a  # stripes, far legs
color M de7426  # orange
color L f0a75a  # light orange
color C f4dab5  # cream: muzzle, chest, paws
color P e48f86  # nose, tongue
color T 23383a  # cushion outline
color t 4d7672  # cushion
color u 7aa69c  # cushion light
color i 355754  # cushion hollow

frame bed 35 9
