anim sleep sleep1:1800 sleep2:1800
anim awake awake:2400 awakeblink:140 awake:1600 awakeblink:120
anim sit sit:2200 sitblink:140 sit:2600 sitblink:120 sit:1800
anim wash lick1:260 lick2:220 lick1:260 lick2:220 lick1:260 lick2:220 lick1:260 sit:900
anim yawn sitblink:200 yawn:1100 sitblink:250
anim walk walk1:150 walk2:150 walk3:150 walk4:150
